title: Edit a wiki
tags: Contents

Any published DecentraWiki wiki can be edited by anyone:

# Press ''Edit this wiki'' at the bottom right of the wiki, or the pencil of the tiddler you want to change.
# The editor opens in a new tab with a copy of the wiki, and the tiddler you chose open for editing.
# Make your changes, then press ''Publish''.
# Share the new address. To propose your version to a project, send its address to the people who maintain the wiki.

If you already have a copy of the same wiki, the editor says so, shows how many tiddlers differ, and lets you open your copy, replace it with this version, or keep both.

!!! When the editor does not open

The pen opens the editor in a new tab. A browser that blocks pop-ups asks you to allow them for the wiki. The pen then also offers to download the wiki as a file, which the editor's ''Import'' reads.